            "review_title": "Review at High Tide Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "TheGame666\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam393 contributions\n0\nAverage, at best....\nJul 2025 • Friends\nAverage.\n++ The open space and the feeling of being outdoors, the screen to watch sports.\n- - The pricing. The pushy hotesses asking you to order more as soon as they spot you finishing your drink\n\nI went for a drink with a friend. The waitress was pushy, as soon as i finished my drink she was on me asking me for \"one more !?!??!\". Felt back in Thailand in a Tourist trap.\nFood wise, I had the worse quesadilla of my life. No joke. 160k for to corn and a big of cheese in between.\nWas about to go for wine, but the glass was like 180k...so I went for beers.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2025",
